First, the point of the *blessed* scrolls of charging is that you can 
recharge the wand, and get three more wishes out of it. How exactly is 
that not worth it?

Well, assuming you have the hitpoints, don't have to many artifacts in 
the game already, and that you are neutral (you said you wanted vorpy, 
which is neutral) I would go for the "Staff of Aesculapius" its a really 
great weapon, but it will zap you when you pick it up. Also, with two 
artifacts you only have a 2/3 chance of getting it.

The next wish should be:
2 *blessed* scrolls of charging

Then charge the wand
And assuming you got the staff before, I would go for:
Boots of Speed
Helm of Brilliance
Magic Marker

And I would save the last wish incase you need something.

You should consider the magic marker, its really a great thing if you 
have a lot of low enchanted armor. You should be able to get several 
scrolls of enchant armor or enchant weapon out of it, and it can be 
recharged and used again (once). Its really a great way to boost AC.




